<name>Managalas population - 20,884 people inside the MCA</name>
<description><![CDATA[Every village in the Afore LLG Ward Profiles, one placemark each, carrying its own population.<br/><br/><b>Inside the conservation area: 73 villages, 20,884 people</b> - the same total as the spreadsheet.<br/>Outside: 6 villages, 639 people, in their own folder and not counted in that total.<br/><br/>Pin colour shows how good the position is. Blue pins are indicative - dragged by hand, some admitted guesses. Red pins have no position at all and sit on their ward centre purely so their people are not missing from the file.]]></description>
